First navigate to the root folder of the project. Then:
START FRONTEND: cd frontend-react && npm run dev
START BACKEND:  cd backend-fastapi && uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000


KILL RUNNING PORTS:
for /f "tokens=5" %a in ('netstat -ano ^| findstr :5173') do taskkill /PID %a /F
for /f "tokens=5" %a in ('netstat -ano ^| findstr :8000') do taskkill /PID %a /F

